zh:
 十二月初七 滹沱北岸     
 辰时五刻（09:00）       
 //切位面，玩家附身梦傀化的王清，也在战斗。只是周围的场景和敌人都特效化了。     
 //玩家操纵王清，但周围是混沌的一片，一些士兵同样站在梦傀王清的身侧。氛围中，传来梦傀士兵的低语。这些士兵也被感染了。     
 //开始的王清处于混沌之中，但慢慢听清晰了士兵们的声音。镜头也会同样打向梦傀化的士兵。     
 //一位梦傀士兵的侧颜     
无名士兵 将军……我们走不了了。     
 //再切一位梦傀士兵的侧颜     
无名士兵 将军……我们还想追随您。     
 //切到很多位梦傀士兵头顶     
无名士兵 将军……我们愿意。     
无名士兵 愿意……舍掉这具好头颅，愿意……死后不上黄泉路。     
 //切到王清的侧颜，士兵呼喊的声音此起彼伏，但听不太清。     
无数士兵的呼喊 将军、将军、将军、将军……     
 //士兵一齐念诵     
无数士兵的呼喊 将军。请您发令一呼——     
 //王清发出悲伤但完全听不清在说什么的低吼声（梦傀的声音）。     
梦傀王清 唔呜呜呜呜呜呜——！     
 //虏人向王清杀来，此时进入战斗状态，王清一派摧枯拉朽。愤怒的吼叫。     
梦傀王清 呜哇哇！

en:
7th Day of the Twelfth Lunar Month, North Bank of Hutuo River
Fifth Quarter of Chen Hour (09:00)
//Seamless scene transition. Player takes on the perspective of Wang Qing, now a Sleeping Puppet in battle. His surrounding environment and enemies are rendered as visual-effect-stylized versions.
//Player takes control of Sleeping Puppet Wang Qing in the blurry surroundings, flanked by other soldiers, who have also become Sleeping Puppets. Their murmurs can be heard, making their affected status obvious.
//Wang Qing is in a confused state in the beginning, but the voices of his fellow soldiers gradually become clearer to him. The camera pans toward these other Sleeping Puppet soldiers as this happens.
//Side profile of a Sleeping Puppet soldier
Nameless Soldier: General... we can no longer move.
//Pans to another Sleeping Puppet soldier
Nameless Soldier: General... we still wish to follow you.
//Cuts to above the heads of a large number of Sleeping Puppet soldiers
Nameless Soldier: General... for you, we will...
Nameless Soldier: We will... abandon our heads, our mortal bodies... and remain among the living, even after death...
//Cuts to Wang Qing's side profile. The soldiers' shouts come in waves, the words barely distinguishable.
Countless Soldiers: General! General! General! General...
//Soldiers chant together
Countless Soldiers: General! We await your command!
//Wang Qing roars in anguish, voice low, words impossible to distinguish (Sleeping Puppet voice).
Sleeping Puppet Wang Qing: Nnng... aaaahhhh!
//The Foreign Invaders charge at Wang Qing. Battle mode is activated. Wang Qing's forces are unstoppable. Enraged roars can be heard.
Sleeping Puppet Wang Qing: Rrrrahhh!

